% capacity — the ALFWorld hierarchy's role vocabulary, k = 8 (semantic-map s-d4270bed; generated by
% world/gen_hier.py capacity(8)): one per robot, never per room. The host binds the roles to its
% semantic map per goal (world/semantic_map.py project): target, the object the goal wants; other, one
% it does not; dest, where it goes; p0, the receptacle where the robot stands; p1..pk, the places most
% likely to hold the target; lhere, ldest, l1..lk, their locations.
catalog capacity 1.
provenance text "the role vocabulary of the ALFWorld specialists, k = 8" "2026-10-24".
type object {target other}.
type receptacle {dest p0 p1 p2 p3 p4 p5 p6 p7 p8}.
type location {lhere ldest l1 l2 l3 l4 l5 l6 l7 l8}.
type thing {target other dest p0 p1 p2 p3 p4 p5 p6 p7 p8}.
